{% comment %}
  D2C Artisan 925 Silver FAQ
  Theme: GIVA / Shaya Handcrafted 925 Silver
{% endcomment %}

<section class="d2c-silver-faq" id="d2c-sifaq-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="d2c-silver-container">
    <div class="d2c-sisec-header">
      <span class="d2c-si-badge">COMMON INQUIRIES</span>
      <h2 class="d2c-si-title">{{ section.settings.title | default: "FREQUENTLY ASKED SILVER QUESTIONS" }}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="d2c-sifaq-list">
      <details class="d2c-sifaq-item" open>
        <summary class="d2c-sifaq-q">
          <span>Does this 925 silver turn black or tarnish?</span>
          <span class="d2c-sifaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-sifaq-a">
          Our jewellery is plated with precious platinum-family rhodium and coated with an invisible anti-tarnish barrier. It protects the sterling silver from oxidation caused by daily moisture, sweat, and air.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="d2c-sifaq-item">
        <summary class="d2c-sifaq-q">
          <span>What is covered under the 6-Month Warranty?</span>
          <span class="d2c-sifaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-sifaq-a">
          We cover free replating, polishing, and manufacturing repairs for 6 months from the date of purchase. Simply message us on WhatsApp with your order ID for free doorstep pickup.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="d2c-sifaq-item">
        <summary class="d2c-sifaq-q">
          <span>Is luxury gift packaging included with every order?</span>
          <span class="d2c-sifaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-sifaq-a">
          Yes! Every single item comes packaged in our signature velvet keepsake gift box, tied with a ribbon, along with an authenticity certificate and silver polishing cloth.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="d2c-sifaq-item">
        <summary class="d2c-sifaq-q">
          <span>Is Cash on Delivery (COD) available nationwide?</span>
          <span class="d2c-sifaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-sifaq-a">
          Yes. Free Cash on Delivery is available across all 24,000+ Indian pincodes without any extra handling fees. Pay via Cash or UPI at your doorstep.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #d2c-sifaq-{{ section.id }} {
    background: #141210;
    padding: 70px 32px;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  .d2c-silver-container { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .d2c-sifaq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .d2c-sifaq-item {
    background: #24201d;
    border: 1px solid rgba(214, 211, 209, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .d2c-sifaq-q {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .d2c-sifaq-q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .d2c-sifaq-icon { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #d6d3d1; }
  details[open] .d2c-sifaq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); display: inline-block; }
  .d2c-sifaq-a {
    padding: 0 24px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #d6d3d1;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Silver FAQ",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "FREQUENTLY ASKED SILVER QUESTIONS"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Silver FAQ"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
